Package: gor-wii-manager
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1,
 python3-cryptography, libzstd1, pkexec | policykit-1, udisks2
Conflicts: wbfs-manager (<< 0.3.0)
Replaces: wbfs-manager (<< 0.3.0)
Description: manager of Wii and GameCube backups (WBFS) for Linux
 A native GTK4/libadwaita application for managing Wii and GameCube
 game backups stored in WBFS partitions or .wbfs files. It can format
 WBFS volumes, import ISO/GCM and compressed RVZ images with scrubbing,
 extract games back to ISO or split WBFS files, copy games between drives,
 verify and repair the free-block table, and show covers and titles from
 GameTDB. RVZ files are decoded natively (Zstd/LZMA/BZip2 and Wii hash
 reconstruction), without requiring Dolphin. Games can also be exported
 into USB loader folder libraries (USB Loader GX/WiiFlow/CFG) with proper
 wbfs/<Title> [<ID>]/<ID>.wbfs layout, optional FAT32 splitting, and
 Nintendont games/<Title> [<ID>]/game.iso for GameCube.
